Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}あっ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}うわぁ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}あなた！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老公！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}あぁっ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ぐっ…　あなた！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…老公！
